@@ -57,0 +58,8 @@ Satisfy SI
+For the offline SI key-value fast reader, `Loading time` ends after JSON input
+decoding and construction of the transaction/operation model. `Checking time`
+starts immediately afterwards and includes the explicit pre-check GC, initial
+state and per-key writer-index construction, commit-timestamp sorting, and the
+SI checker itself. Result and violation printing remain outside `Checking
+time`. This boundary is intended for comparisons that exclude input-format
+loading but include all checker-specific preparation.
